    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The discovery of an old magic book turns your life upside down. Will you succeed in becoming a guild wizard? Or will you travel a different path instead, striking out on your own, moving to a different plane of existence\u2014or perhaps not even remaining human?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Wizardry Level C</i> is a 100,000-word interactive novel by Jacic where your choices control the story. It's entirely text-based--without graphics or sound effects--and fueled by the vast, unstoppable power of your imagination.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Play as male or female</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Choose your name, elemental alignment and area of magical focus.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Explore worlds both on and off Earth, full of magical creatures.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Track your standing with the wizardry guild and your success in completing the tasks they set.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Enjoy replaying the game with branching story lines and over 19 different endings.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Make use of save points to replay some sections without having to restart the story from the beginning.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > And well....who wouldn't want to be a wizard?</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pass or Fail. Earth or Ether. Live or Die.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The discovery of an old magic book turns your life upside down. Will you succeed in becoming a guild wizard? Or will you travel a different path instead, striking out on your own, moving to a different plane of existence\u2014or perhaps not even remaining human?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Wizardry Level C</i> is a 100,000-word interactive novel by Jacic where your choices control the story. It's entirely text-based--without graphics or sound effects--and fueled by the vast, unstoppable power of your imagination.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Play as male or female</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Choose your name, elemental alignment and area of magical focus.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Explore worlds both on and off Earth, full of magical creatures.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Track your standing with the wizardry guild and your success in completing the tasks they set.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Enjoy replaying the game with branching story lines and over 19 different endings.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Make use of save points to replay some sections without having to restart the story from the beginning.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > And well....who wouldn't want to be a wizard?</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pass or Fail. Earth or Ether. Live or Die.</p>",
